      "id": "G01",
      "status": "READY_WITH_PRECISE_BOUNDARIES",
      "title": "默认与 Session configure 的解码和事务分支可在既有路径完成",
      "actual_facts": [
        "当前 DecodeEnvelope 的 MODEL_CHANGE_WITHOUT_EPOCH 阻止全null默认configure；writeMethods未包含host.configure且无handler。",
        "冻结文档要求不适用字段显式null；session为空时仅默认配置，session非空必须project/revision/epoch齐备。"
      ],
      "required_scope_or_interface_decision": [
        "明确接受A全null(scope四字段)和B全非null(session/project/positive revision/epoch)两形状；拒绝missing key、空串、混合scope。默认分支在generic Session gate之前，但仍验证当前OWNER、trusted localHost与完整typed payload。",
        "可在client_protocol.go保存严格原始Envelope字节/规范化完整请求；不能先json.Unmarshal去掉重复key或未知字节后再声称验证了原始输入。",
        "成功session配置同时head+1/session revision+1，writer_epoch和event_watermark保持；default不改变任何Session/Run。无CONFIG_CHANGED枚举，不造新事件。"
      ],
