    {
      "id": "G03",
      "status": "READY_WITH_PERSISTED_CREATION_CHECK",
      "title": "session.create 的 derived SessionID 例外必须仅限原创建成功",
      "actual_facts": [
        "真实createClientSession返回新sid作为顶层和result.session_id；request.session_id为null。",
        "项目级goal.start故意顶层null、真实新sid在result.snapshot；session scoped goal.start保留原sid。",
        "当前decodeClientIdentityResponse一律等于request.SessionID，因此新创建响应需方法特例。"
      ],
      "required_scope_or_interface_decision": [
        "仅 session.create + COMPLETED + request.SessionID null 接受derived非空sid，要求result.sid==response.sid、result.project==request.project、原session行以及唯一原创建journal归属principal一致。其余状态/方法继续原一致性。",
        "解码器本身没有tx：在lookupClientCommandIdentity已有caller Tx内加持久创建核验，或私有分层函数；不能把任意非空result.sid当持久证明。新响应在原journal INSERT之后作同样postcondition核验。",
        "goal.start项目级保持顶层null；创建身份核验用原result.snapshot，不补写假session.create journal，不因后续Session revision变化破坏原replay。"
      ],
