    {
      "id": "G04",
      "status": "READY_WITH_REPLAY_ORDER_CONDITIONS",
      "title": "新 raw principal 与旧 prefixed principal 原样回放可保留备份守卫",
      "actual_facts": [
        "host.status目前输出principal:+principal；backup只对已有global identity的host.status要求result.authenticated_principal_ref等于raw principal。",
        "lookup扫描principal+command整个v2 namespace，reserve helper会给旧回放补identity，H1必须在调用reserve前分支返回旧回执。"
      ],
      "required_scope_or_interface_decision": [
        "真实身份认证先行；global lookup先于任何业务变更/Session CAS。旧存在且唯一、request完整hash匹配的原响应原样返回，不能调用reserve自动回填；不同project/method/client/payload/null区别的相同command冲突。",
        "新命令reserve与原journal同caller Tx；建议reserve在business savepoint之外，REJECTED回滚业务后仍保存该合法rejected response+identity；schema/commit错误回滚全部。不得留orphan identity。",
        "ACK session.control在global lookup命中后仍进入原有受保护finalization路径；不能简单return绕开它，也不修F081811。",
        "新host.status raw principal是合同string合法形式；旧prefixed不重写、不自动链接。按此选择无需修改backup_host_configuration.go，真实新status/session多方法全量backup是必需控制。"
      ],
