    {
      "id": "G05",
      "status": "REVISION_REQUIRED",
      "title": "离线可见性与执行准入要分开，不能靠缺 row 判 legacy",
      "actual_facts": [
        "createBoundClientSession目前调用checkClientBinding，后者要求SessionRuntime非nil；无coordinator的启动handler无法创建离线Session。",
        "CreateSessionPayload.model_config_ref与SessionSnapshot.model_config_ref都必须非空string；null不是请求使用default的语义。",
        "sessionModel只接project/ref，没有SessionID或principal；同时供AdmitTurn、sessionTaskRoute和任务输入冻结/写权限使用。"
      ],
      "required_scope_or_interface_decision": [
        "新configuration authority应独立于SessionRuntime；离线create仍需真实Workspace binding、当前Host/OWNER和typed config可见性，不能绕过目录撤销检查。NORMAL/goal实际执行保持currentRuntimeAdmission和原effect gates。",
        "新session.create必须显式已存ref；禁止null/空串/缺失时latest/default fallback。用户选default由host.status返回的head配置明确ref完成。",
        "提交可重算provenance规则：新创建global identity+原creation response的ref、后续成功session-scoped configure的原请求/响应链证明typed绑定。legacy只依据真实旧creation/运行profile身份；缺typed row、mc-字符串前缀或任意现行head都不是legacy授权。",
        "旧Session改绑后不得把创建时legacy永久当豁免；当前session.model_config_ref必须和原创建或最后合法scoped配置链相符。损坏/歧义拒绝。历史read/backup不等于当前可执行。",
        "sessionModel shared签名可保持，在已有路径中按trusted port owner/principal+ref验证；如果设计需每Session参数，必须列出所有外部调用者再扩scope，不能漏client_workspace_write_windows.go。"
      ],
